    "lawCode": "Amd §1210, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S2805\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the tax law, in relation to extending the\nauthorization of the county of Chenango to impose an additional one\npercent of sales and compensating use taxes\n\n\n PURPOSE OF BILL :\nThis bill authorizes the County of Chenango to extend one percent\nsales tax through 2011.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\nThis bill extends to the County of Chenango's current one percent\nsales tax for two years.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nThe Chenango County legislature has requested legislation to extend\nthe County sales tax which is set to expire on November 13, 2009.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone to the State.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
